{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clean Start</strong>, you <strong>clean and organize</strong> other people\u2019s homes while <strong>uncovering heartfelt stories</strong> through the objects you find. Piece together each room\u2019s narrative, <strong>discover hidden secrets</strong>, and <strong>experience the satisfaction</strong> of tidying up spaces in this <strong>cozy puzzle game</strong> set in a country whose language you don\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience satisfaction from tidying up spaces, without time pressure or stressful game overs. Sink into a highly satisfying activity and let yourself be drawn into a trance of warmth and comfort. Enjoy a relaxing puzzle experience that\u2019s easy to pick up and offers a break from the stresses of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dialogues provide context, the main story of each level is told through the discovery of interesting objects. Players must piece together the story, either to satisfy their curiosity or to help the clients with more than just a dirty apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own cozy space in a rented apartment using items found while cleaning. Your conversations with your employers\u2014and the gifts they give you\u2014will vary depending on what you discover in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Lena, an immigrant maid, as she tries to communicate with her clients using a limited understanding of a foreign language. <strong>Clean Start</strong> is a game inspired by real experiences, highlighting the worries and hopes of immigrant life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, cozy and positive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying gameplay with no time limits or game overs, but with multiple solutions and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling \u2013 piece together a heartfelt and emotional story about life in a new country.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dioramas, filled with hundreds of interesting items waiting to be cleaned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive elements to engage with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personal cozy space in a rented apartment, arranged using items found while cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and accessible controls.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577020?t=1772829487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/617e29d0068fa050b97c88e84227d3c5066ea0e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772829487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/17f9b35dcfc545b002e8fee2d40717cbd391bf2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772829487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/17f9b35dcfc545b002e8fee2d40717cbd391bf2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772829487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3693950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/09dd5da9eabcb9c67607b196bae5338a.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clean Start</strong>, you <strong>clean and organize</strong> other people\u2019s homes while <strong>uncovering heartfelt stories</strong> through the objects you find. Piece together each room\u2019s narrative, <strong>discover hidden secrets</strong>, and <strong>experience the satisfaction</strong> of tidying up spaces in this <strong>cozy puzzle game</strong> set in a country whose language you don\u2019t fully understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/6a2357d073e6162408070d7fe79d1650.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience satisfaction from tidying up spaces, without time pressure or stressful game overs. Sink into a highly satisfying activity and let yourself be drawn into a trance of warmth and comfort. Enjoy a relaxing puzzle experience that\u2019s easy to pick up and offers a break from the stresses of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/c14f1acbc67bf517e5e6909373a075bc.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dialogues provide context, the main story of each level is told through the discovery of interesting objects. Players must piece together the story, either to satisfy their curiosity or to help the clients with more than just a dirty apartment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/edc393df08406c32c44b05f420a151c9.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own cozy space in a rented apartment using items found while cleaning. Your conversations with your employers\u2014and the gifts they give you\u2014will vary depending on what you discover in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.poster.avif?t=1772829487\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.webm?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/extras/2bab1562695c33f5f87d949a5e5acb50.mp4?t=1772829487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Lena, an immigrant maid, as she tries to communicate with her clients using a limited understanding of a foreign language. <strong>Clean Start</strong> is a game inspired by real experiences, highlighting the worries and hopes of immigrant life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, cozy and positive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying gameplay with no time limits or game overs, but with multiple solutions and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling \u2013 piece together a heartfelt and emotional story about life in a new country.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dioramas, filled with hundreds of interesting items waiting to be cleaned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive elements to engage with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personal cozy space in a rented apartment, arranged using items found while cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and accessible controls.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Serious Sim"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577020/1eda689583b382a16591ccfc9a5a2d1d6bd5ce78/header.jpg?t=1772829487","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Serious Sim","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577020/474739920/cf7b42de6f739edcf33eb9921c6d52047ffe2e76/1772476126/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772643666","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577020/474739920/cf7b42de6f739edcf33eb9921c6d52047ffe2e76/1772476126/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772643666","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577020/474739920/cf7b42de6f739edcf33eb9921c6d52047ffe2e76/1772476126/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772643666","id":257296855,"name":"Clean Start Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257296855/6ac86ad83d54b3e39722df82ef391cbaf7c6725b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772643666"}],"name":"Clean 